vdkr x86_64 Blobs
====================

This directory should contain the kernel and initramfs for x86_64 vdkr.

Required files:
  - bzImage            (Linux kernel for x86_64)
  - initramfs.cpio.gz  (vdkr initramfs with Docker tools)

To build these blobs:

  MACHINE=qemux86-64 bitbake vdkr-initramfs-create

Then copy from the deploy directory:

  cp tmp/deploy/images/qemux86-64/vdkr-initramfs/bzImage \
     meta-virtualization/recipes-containers/vdkr/files/blobs/x86_64/

  cp tmp/deploy/images/qemux86-64/vdkr-initramfs/initramfs.cpio.gz \
     meta-virtualization/recipes-containers/vdkr/files/blobs/x86_64/

Alternatively, set VDKR_USE_DEPLOY = "1" in local.conf to use blobs
directly from DEPLOY_DIR without copying to the layer.
